 "text": "keel. (https://keel.example)\n\nYOUR SIGN-IN CODE\n\nEnter it in the Keel app to finish signing in. It works once, for the next ten minutes.\n\n482 913\n\nExpires at 06:52 GMT\n\nWho asked for it\n\nDevice | Safari on a Mac\nNear | Lisbon, Portugal\nWhen | 06:42 GMT, Friday 6 November\n\nNot you?\n\nDon’t share this code with anyone, even someone who says they’re from Keel. Freeze your cards in the app, or call us any time on 0808 157 0412 (tel:+448081570412).\n\nWe’ll never ask for this code by phone, email or text. Keel Bank Ltd, 12 Lantern Yard, London E1 6QL.",
